      root_cause: "method_starved_modules (verify_claims.py) reports a module STARVED when no edge into it carries a matching call_construct, even when classify_call classified an edge into it. First bad commit a7495d9b9a added cli.py _dt.date.today(); py.py stamps no call_construct on a module-rooted dotted chain, so datetime.date (methods-only row) starved -> qualifying_only False -> every claim inconclusive."  # a7cd
