- op: discuss  # 3e48
  at: '2026-09-23T08:11:40Z'  # 3e48
  by: agent  # 3e48
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3e48
  clock: 5  # 3e48
  nonce: '3e48'  # 3e48
  message: "FIXED in PR #1150 (94d30be466). FILED REPRO RE-RUN ON MERGED dev: `XDG_CACHE_HOME=<fresh> scripts/check-self-claims` at 94d30be466 -> rc 0, \"check-self-claims-drift: OK — 18 claims unchanged (18 confirmed_with_caveats)\", 224 s cold. The same command's equivalent at 91d56790e3 (dev tip without the fix, pinned worktree) printed the 40-line drift, line-for-line the CI drift at 9aac6ffe8d.\n\nROOT CAUSE: a7495d9b9a added `_dt.date.today()` to cli.py. py.py emits a module-rooted chain with no call_construct; datetime.date.today was a METHOD-kind row, so method_starved_modules found no route to satisfy datetime.date and reported it structurally invisible, although classify_call classifies the edge (host_info_read). Starvation is not the qualifying incompleteness, so every claim was withheld.\n\nFIX: datetime.date.today and datetime.datetime.now/utcnow/today are classmethod_descriptors (inspect.getattr_static) -> function-kind rows (INV-nular's Path.cwd rule). The starvation gate is NOT loosened (an unstamped edge naming a method row still starves, pinned). New sweep test: no python method-kind row on an importable class may be a classmethod/staticmethod -- it found exactly these 4; rows on 7 non-importable (third-party) modules are NOT checked.\n\nPER-CLAIM, vs the last good commit 1018e5b35e: verdict, evidence_count, sanitized_flows (e.g. runtime-cli-no-subprocess 11 -> 0 without the fix -> 11), excluded_flows and caveat kinds identical on all 18. SECURITY.md needs no change: the snapshot was not re-recorded. Exposure of the new function-kind short-name match: 0 unstamped python:external now/today/utcnow edges across 7 older python surveys (~284k call edges).\n\nNOT YET SEEN: a green cron firing. Local reproduction matched CI exactly in both directions, but the next full-suite firing is the independent confirmation -- check `ci-debug cron-status`.\n\nRESIDUALS FILED: WI-torin (P3, from-imported-class classmethod `date.today()` / `Path.cwd()` unclassified), WI-lapof (P2, a red cron gate reaches no reader -- this one sat 4 days)."  # 3e48
